abstract: "The HonorlyAI K-12 AI Governance Toolkit is a collection of free, editable resources for school districts, educators, technology leaders, families, and students. It includes practical templates and checklists for AI vendor evaluation, student acceptable-use policies, classroom AI-use levels, parent communication, pilot planning, privacy review, academic integrity, incident response, data lifecycle management, and responsible implementation. The materials are designed to support local decision-making while preserving teacher oversight, student privacy, academic integrity, accessibility, and district control."
